<title>USA: Shuffle Master launches stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Shuffle Master launches stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shuffle Master Inc said Wednesday it initiated a previously announced stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, the company disclosed plans to buy back up to $5 million of its common shares. It began actually buying the shares early this week, said Shuffle Master.</p>
<p>Shuffle Master provides automated card shuffling eauipment and other products to the casino industry.</p>
<p>The company's stock is up 1/2 at 9-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
